uot;r&quot;, encoding = encoding) :</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">  cannot open file &#39;packrat/init.R&#39;: No such file or directory</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Execution halted</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">################################# End Task Log ################################# </div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Erreur : Unhandled Exception: Child Task 66666046 failed: Error building image: Error building git2r (0.11.0). Build exited with non-zero status: 1</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">but my D:\\datasciencecoursera\\DSCapstoneShinyApp\\.Rprofile contains:</span></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;box-sizing:border-box\">#### -- Packrat Autoloader (version 0.4.4) -- ####</div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;box-sizing:border-box\">source(&quot;packrat/init.R&quot;)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;box-sizing:border-box\">#### -- End Packrat Autoloader -- ####</div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;box-sizing:border-box\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">I tried to stop using packrat in my project, deleting all packrat subdirs and use it again, without any result. <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;box-sizing:border-box\"><ul style=\"box-